    "long_instructions": "You are the owner of **Sweet Bytes Bakery**. To keep your hungry customers updated on what's fresh out of the oven, you use a Social Media Scheduler.\r\n\r\nBased on the updates that you receive over the next four levels, use **PAIR Programming with AI** to  help manage your postings:\r\n\r\n* **Prompt:** Ask AI to generate or explain a helper.\r\n\r\n* **Analyze:** Compare two possible versions or lines of code.\r\n\r\n* **Integrate:** Implement and test in the display.\r\n\r\n* **Reflect:** Write a short statement about how helper functions protect data consistency in *reflection.md*\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 🍩 Surprise Pop-up!\r\n**Status:** New Event Added\r\n\r\n**Details:** You decided to host a \"Donut Pop-up\" this Friday to celebrate the weekend!\r\n\r\n**Action Required:** Add this special event to the end of your schedule.\r\n\r\n* **Title:** \"Donut Friday\"\r\n* **Content:** \"Hot glazed donuts until sold out!\"\r\n* **Image:** \"donut.jpg\"",
